oneOf.description:
Opens a files panel on `root` (or points an existing one there);
replies `created` with the panel's id as `tile`. Panels live outside
the session and aren't saved; shells open them again after a relaunch.

filter.description:
Event names or prefixes. `tile.created` matches that event only;
`tile.`, `tile.*` and `tile` match every `tile.…` event. Empty or absent
means every event.

ended.description:
The herdr pane is gone (its process exited with `on_exit = "keep"`,
or it was lost with its server). The shell offers Respawn or Close;
binding a new pane clears it.

